---
import '../styles/prepared-context.css';
---
<section class='prepared-context form-wide' data-prepared-context hidden aria-labelledby='prepared-context-title'>
 <span class='section-label'>Your starting point</span><h2 id='prepared-context-title'>Continue the thought.</h2><p>The perspectives you explored are carried into your editable message below. Keep what matters, add your own context and review everything before sharing.</p>
 <ul data-prepared-context-items></ul><div class='prepared-context-actions'><button type='button' data-prepared-context-copy>Copy context</button><button type='button' data-prepared-context-save>Save context</button><button type='button' data-prepared-context-clear>Remove context</button></div>
 <p class='prepared-context-status' role='status' data-prepared-context-status></p>
</section>
